OL,3,GNEWSAMum joins call for blood donors
OL,4,Aafter three tablespoons saved
OL,5,Adaughter's life
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of premature baby whose life
OL,8,Fwas saved by a transfusion has called
OL,9,Ffor people to give blood as supplies
OL,10,Fface "a significant drop".
OL,12,FCaitlyn Stewart's daughter Millie
OL,13,Fweighed just 1lb 8oz (670g) when she
OL,14,Fwas born three months early in
OL,15,FFebruary.
OL,17,FMillie spent 10 weeks in the neonatal
OL,18,Fintensive care unit (NICU) at the Queen
OL,19,FElizabeth University Hospital in
OL,20,FGlasgow, where she received two 23
OL,21,Fmillilitre blood transfusions.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
